# MASTER PRODUCT & IMPLEMENTATION PROMPT

# FAHAM AYAT — THE WORLD OF MEANING

## Transform an Existing Arabic & Quran Learning Platform into an Innovative Gamified Learning Experience

You are a senior product designer, educational game designer, Arabic language learning specialist, UX/UI engineer, and full-stack developer.

Do NOT start from scratch. Do NOT replace the existing application with a generic website template. Inspect the current codebase, understand its architecture, preserve the strongest working features, and implement a coherent game-based learning experience within the existing product.

The existing product serves learners in Indonesia and Malaysia who want to learn Arabic, understand Quranic Arabic, improve Quran reading, and understand prayer recitations.

The central objective is to differentiate the platform from conventional Arabic-learning websites, repetitive quizzes, and ordinary Quran applications.

Create a connected educational game world in which learners acquire Arabic by moving through environments, accomplishing tasks, interpreting visual scenes, solving problems, and understanding meaningful language in context.

The product must be genuinely playable, educationally coherent, visually distinctive, localized, accessible, and technically maintainable.

Do not merely generate a product plan, screenshots, or nonfunctional mockups. Implement the application.

